  "dct_description_sm": [
    "To acquire a high resolution Digital Surface Model (DSM) of Siksik Creek basin (a small tributary of Trail Valley Creek) using a Unmanned Aerial System (UAS). DSMs were created during end of winter snow covered conditions and late August snow-free conditions. This creates a 3D model of Siksik Creek basin during these two periods."
